  "name": "Warding Wind",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/magic/air/wind-tornado-funnel-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><ul>A strong wind (20 miles per hour) blows around you in a 10-foot radius and moves with you, remaining centered on you. The wind lasts for the creation’s duration.\nThe wind has the following effects:\n<em> It deafens you and other creatures in its area.\n</em> It extinguishes unprotected flames in its area that are torch-sized or smaller.\n<em> The area is difficult terrain for creatures other than you.\n</em> The attack rolls of ranged weapon attacks have disadvantage if they pass in or out of the wind.</p><p><li>It hedges out vapor, gas, and fog that can be dispersed by strong wind.</li></ul></p>",
